Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:08.71,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,He's trying to live earnestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:10.57,italics,LILY/ID,0,0,0,,But he's just so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:15.57,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Did you not think it was weird that \Nnobody actually uses that armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:19.47,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,None of the Beast's Fangs \Nmembers used it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:27.14,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I just thought nobody else could \Nget their hands on this armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:32.56,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I thought if I wore this, you'd \Nstamp your feet in frustration...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.84,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm so frustrated!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:36.05,main,REIN,0,0,0,,...and I could look down on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:37.52,main,MARGARET & LILY,0,0,0,,His personality's rotten, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:54.58,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE LAID-OFF CHEAT-GRANTING MAGE\NENJOYS A SECOND LEASE ON LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:14.72,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I didn't choose to become an \Nenchanter instead of an adventurer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:16.20,main,REIN,0,0,0,,for any particular reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:17.24,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Where's your motivation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:23.95,main,REIN,0,0,0,,But I think I subconsciously chose \Nthe role with less responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:29.70,main,REIN,0,0,0,,When you're an adventurer, your actions \Ncould hurt the people around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.15,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I guess he's not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:35.83,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:39.73,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Now I'm scared of losing you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:46.31,main,REIN,0,0,0,,The Radiant Dragon Ruins in Gadressa, \Nthe eastern capital, are dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:54.22,main,LILY,0,0,0,,If we're discussing risks,\NI shouldn't be adventuring anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:03:00.44,main,LILY,0,0,0,,But still, I have to go to \Nthe Radiant Dragon Ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:05.23,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,If Lily's going, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:07.95,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I need to confirm why my sister died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:07.95,main,REIN,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:12.54,main,REIN,0,0,0,,if you die before you achieve your goals, \Nyou won't be able to fulfill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.30,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:20.49,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'm worried you'll get tunnel vision \Nand won't retreat if things get dicey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:24.05,main,REIN,0,0,0,,So I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:28.31,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Let me lead this adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:32.90,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,You, the least experienced of us three?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:35.65,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I guess you're not over your \Nhabit of joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.05,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Naturally, I'll need your \Nexperience and advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:42.51,main,REIN,0,0,0,,but I think I can stay \Ncalmer than you two,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:45.41,main,REIN,0,0,0,,so I want you to let me have \Nthe final say in any decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:49.91,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You mean we have to retreat if you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.91,0:03:53.45,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Yeah. Naturally, we'd \Ntry again in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:55.00,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You're okay with that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.62,0:04:02.02,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I suppose. I'll leave it up to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:04.01,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Okay, Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:05.78,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You're our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:06.78,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:11.48,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Then put your equipment on \Nthe table. I'll enchant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:11.99,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.48,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:16.19,main,LILY,0,0,0,,How many times have \NI told you I don't need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.19,0:04:18.97,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You have to. Maybe it's not necessary \Nto enchant your weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.97,0:04:21.49,main,REIN,0,0,0,,but I'm enchanting your \Narmor no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:23.84,main,REIN,0,0,0,,so we can all make it back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.61,main,REIN,0,0,0,,That's my decision as party leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.03,0:04:29.98,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Is this why you wanted to be the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:30.87,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:36.93,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Then please enchant my gear, leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:43.14,top,EPTITLE,0,0,0,,THERE'S SOMETHING I'VE LEARNED FROM ENDING UP NAKED\NTWICE... WHEN YOU'RE NAKED, YOU GET BITTEN TWICE.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:51.93,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily, I applied 300 bonus \Npoints to your armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:55.52,main,REIN,0,0,0,,That's the current max I can \Napply to another person's armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:57.56,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Th-Three hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:05:02.67,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Even high-level enchanters can only \Ngrant between three and five points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:05.77,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,That's an impossible value.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:09.21,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Margaret, let me see your armor, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.03,0:05:14.49,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I've adventured without owing \Nany debts or favors until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:16.89,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I don't want to owe you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:19.25,main,REIN,0,0,0,,You won't owe me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:23.26,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'm just doing what I can \Nbecause we're going together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:24.81,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Because we're allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:26.98,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:31.26,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,My sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:38.30,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,My sister trusted her allies, \Nbut she died while adventuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:42.90,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,The allies you trust to watch \Nyour back sometimes run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:47.57,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,So I don't need allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:49.58,main,REIN,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:51.37,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,This conversation is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:55.13,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Please leave. We'll meet again \Nwhen it's time to depart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:00.39,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:15.77,flashback,MELISSA,0,0,0,,Margaret, come eat with us over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:21.45,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Half of those adventurers \Nare already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:25.20,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,That woman made a stupid mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:28.13,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,and her allies paid \Nfor it with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.07,0:06:36.55,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Maybe adventuring with allies is more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.30,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,We could even help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:43.91,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,But allies are a sweet \Nnectar tainted with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:48.92,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,I've always survived on my strength alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:51.30,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Let's go for a—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:59.00,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing, Rein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.92,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.94,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Naked while being bitten by a dog?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.50,main,REIN,0,0,0,,My clothes are enchanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:08.45,main,REIN,0,0,0,,They're tough enough to screw up \Nsomeone's hand if they hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:11.20,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I did this to save the \Ndog's teeth when it bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:12.82,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I stripped for the dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:14.83,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MY FIRST SEXY EXPERIENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.83,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,You stripped for the dog?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:16.16,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.44,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:22.63,top,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I'm always telling you \Nnot to eat weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:24.22,top,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Please be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:26.81,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,She was talking to the dog, \Nnot me. So politely, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:33.32,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,She must not open up to anyone \Nif she speaks formally to dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:27.21,top,MARGARET,0,0,0,,There's bacteria everywhere. \NParasites, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:30.23,top,MARGARET,0,0,0,,It's raw. You have to cook it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.64,0:07:33.97,top,MARGARET,0,0,0,,It's best to cook it until \Nit's a little burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:40.31,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I can't bring your master with \Nme unless I enchant her armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:43.44,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Could you help me keep her \Nhere until she lets me—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:50.54,main,REIN,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.82,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Now this is +300, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:57.24,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,I can't put a single scratch on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:59.62,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Well, Margaret? Nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:03.23,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Shit. It really is +300.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:06.19,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,If Lily's armor has the same enchantment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.30,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,I can't kill her with this sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:13.97,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Rein, could you enchant \Nthis sword, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.45,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Here, Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:22.10,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,It's my spare armor.\NTake it with my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:27.18,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I'm nobody's ally, so neither \Nof us owe each other anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:31.77,main,REIN,0,0,0,,See you later, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:38.80,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Now I can kill her once she's exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:44.05,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,What is it, Rein? Did you forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:49.29,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Cornelius of the Beast's Fangs and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:51.14,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:54.47,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,We're kidnapping Rein. Join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:58.18,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Did you already forget \Nthat he beat you once?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:59.83,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,And I don't work with weak—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:00.73,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,We're coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:02.26,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.82,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,You can't invite yourselves into—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:11.48,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I see. You seem like you'd \Nbe able to kidnap Rein,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:16.41,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Vice Guildmaster of the \NBeast's Fangs, Glenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:21.31,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,The Beast's Fangs are \Npursuing a new direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:25.57,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,We'll kidnap and imprison Rein and \Nforce him to enchant our gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:29.85,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,With his enchantment abilities, our \Nformer members will come back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.13,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,And you're going after Rein with...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:37.61,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,Cornelius, I told you to find an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.18,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,Is that child her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:43.18,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,An assassin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.53,0:09:47.22,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,I doubt that child could kill Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.23,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,You're so useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:54.40,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,Shut up, hag. I-I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:12.96,main,GLENDA,0,0,0,,C-Cornelius, what—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:17.04,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit \Nabout the Beast's Fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:20.16,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,Killing Rein and Lily is \Nmore important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:24.82,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll remain a laughingstock \Nin this business forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:36.73,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,Mirabel, you've proven your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:41.91,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,I'm formally hiring you to \Nkill Lily. Here's your pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:45.61,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:48.64,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,We'll clean up the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:52.55,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Of course you will. And I will kill Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:55.34,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,If you'll agree not to \Ninterfere with my plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:58.26,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I'll tell you when Rein \Nand Lily are leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.70,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,where they're going, about their \Nequipment, and anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:06.59,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,I've heard about your feud with \NLily. I won't get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.98,0:11:12.86,main,CORNELIUS,0,0,0,,I'm just going to kill Rein \Nwhether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:56.62,italics,NARRATION,0,0,0,,Gadressa, the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:11.37,italics,NARRATION,0,0,0,,Located a two-hour carriage \Nride from the capital are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.05,main,REIN,0,0,0,,We're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:27.42,main,REIN,0,0,0,,So that's the notoriously \Ndifficult dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.67,main,REIN,0,0,0,,the Radiant Dragon Ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:32.46,italics,NARRATION,0,0,0,,The Radiant Dragon Ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:42.73,italics,NARRATION,0,0,0,,In their depths is the radiant blade said \Nto possess the power of dragons, Lefaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:49.71,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LEFAID
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:46.23,italics,NARRATION,0,0,0,,It is defended by a high-level dragon in \Nthe ruins on the outskirts of Gadressa,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:48.81,italics,NARRATION,0,0,0,,the Kingdom of Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:02.46,main,REIN,0,0,0,,What a big temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:09.67,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Lily, is there anything we should watch \Nout for? What's it like in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:14.98,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Margaret. I don't \Nremember anything about the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:20.81,main,LILY,0,0,0,,All I remember is feeling powerlessness \Nand despair. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:24.60,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I see. Then let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:29.38,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:35.69,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,She doesn't remember \Nanything? There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:41.38,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is a dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:43.48,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Don't get distracted. It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:49.39,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I still believe Lily abandoned \Neveryone and fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:51.54,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,What do you think, Rein?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.17,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I don't think she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:14:00.16,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'm hoping we can confirm that \Nhere so you two can make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:01.23,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:04.73,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Your sister and Lily were allies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:08.70,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I bet your sister would \Nwant you to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:13.34,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I've been tracking Lily's movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:16.52,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I heard she can't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.97,0:14:20.58,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,But if she's here, \Nthat must be a lie, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:23.42,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,You can fight, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:28.49,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Fighting still makes Lily shake \Ntoo badly to hold a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:30.08,main,REIN,0,0,0,,She can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.03,main,REIN,0,0,0,,But she still teaches me, \Na novice adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:34.52,main,REIN,0,0,0,,using her knowledge and experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:37.65,main,REIN,0,0,0,,That's why I'm with Lily right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:38.99,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.69,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Margaret...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:44.94,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,So she came even though she can't fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.69,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:50.28,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,They must both be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:56.20,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,I'm always the only one \Ntaking shit seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:13.05,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:15.29,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,They call this place impregnable,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:18.66,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,but it's got the same \Ngoblins you'd see anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.81,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Come at me, weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.23,0:15:38.45,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,I'm here now because you might try \Nto hide evidence of the past, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.33,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Right now, you're just a useless coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:47.00,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Now that I'm here, I have to progress, \Neven if I have to do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:56.12,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,Crap. If they all attack me at once, \Nthey'll stab each other, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:59.60,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,This is why they call \Nthis place impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.26,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Lily?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.27,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Don't move! Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.32,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Margaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:25.50,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I was worried your armor couldn't \Nblock all their attacks and panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.13,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,You managed to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:31.97,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:36.61,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I thought you shook too much \Nto do anything in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:45.19,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,I hope you'll gain the ability \Nto wield a sword next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:48.42,main,LILY,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:17:01.40,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll stick with you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.40,0:17:02.16,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:08.71,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Rein?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.53,0:17:10.92,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:15.26,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,More importantly, Rein, why is your \Nsword so extraordinarily power—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:26.28,main,REIN,0,0,0,,It's collapsing! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:29.77,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Your attacks are so excessive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.15,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Just how much did you enchant that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:33.88,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:35.68,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Seriously, what the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:36.95,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Rein, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:44.51,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:02.88,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Who even cares about him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:04.97,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Did we need to focus on him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.37,main,REIN,0,0,0,,W-We survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:12.93,main,LILY,0,0,0,,We're completely lost now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:14.01,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:19.24,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Your sword broke again. \NHow many did you bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:22.89,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I still have more than 20 left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:25.29,main,REIN,0,0,0,,When my cheap enchanted swords break,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:29.50,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I retrieve their bonus points and \Ntransfer them to a new sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:32.38,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I always keep two enchanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:35.48,main,REIN,0,0,0,,That's my best option right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:38.38,italics,MARGARET/ID,0,0,0,,So he's not acting completely \Nwithout thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:42.01,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'll transfer the points now. \NGive me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.77,0:18:46.30,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Feel free to chat while you're waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.50,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,N-Nice weather we're having.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:55.68,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:02.10,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Have you remembered anything \Nsince entering the ruins?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:06.16,main,LILY,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.37,0:19:16.63,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:21.78,main,LILY,0,0,0,,think I passed through here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:26.79,main,LILY,0,0,0,,With the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:32.75,main,LILY,0,0,0,,I should remember more if we keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:40.14,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,That last goblin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:44.52,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,I happened to hit him, \Nbut if he had survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.69,0:19:49.83,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,These swords aren't good enough. \NI can't protect the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:54.17,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,Lefaid will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:02.01,main,REIN,0,0,0,,It's an old gold coin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:06.32,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,This is the first treasure \NI acquired on an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:08.79,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,I'm a real adventurer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:09.93,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.70,main,LILY,0,0,0,,What did you just pick up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:14.46,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Was it treasure? Show us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:17.67,main,LILY,0,0,0,,It's customary to split \Nany treasure you find.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:21.32,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,If you don't, it usually \Nturns into a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:22.41,main,REIN,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:24.72,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Please don't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:25.40,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Just show us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:27.24,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Why are you so infuriating?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:30.04,main,LILY,0,0,0,,This coin is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.65,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:36.97,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Can I keep this, Margaret?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:40.33,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Yes. I owe you for saving me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.33,0:20:41.08,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:45.19,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You can have this coin as a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:46.96,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,We'll make an exception this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:52.33,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Lily, Margaret...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:53.85,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:56.65,main,LILY,0,0,0,,You're done enchanting your gear, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:20:58.25,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.69,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:08.76,main,REIN,0,0,0,,There's something on the ground again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:10.31,main,LILY,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.31,0:21:12.20,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we split \Nthe treasure evenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:15.83,main,REIN,0,0,0,,What? This can't be mine, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.83,0:21:18.25,main,LILY,0,0,0,,A piece of paper? What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:20.86,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Don't keep us waiting. \NTell us what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:28.44,italics,REIN/ID,0,0,0,,"Lily Flambert killed us"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:31.94,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:32.92,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Show us, Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:35.35,main,REIN,0,0,0,,It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.77,0:21:37.42,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Show us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.68,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Why are you hiding it, Rein?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:44.25,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Come on, guys! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:47.61,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I'll just stick this in my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.66,main,REIN,0,0,0,,This armor is massively enchanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:52.62,main,REIN,0,0,0,,No matter how much you \Npull on it, it's pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:54.64,main,REIN,0,0,0,,Give that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:21:57.12,main,REIN,0,0,0,,I didn't enchant my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:21:58.38,main,LILY,0,0,0,,Show us the paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:21:59.38,main,MARGARET,0,0,0,,Show us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:02.71,main,REIN,0,0,0,,S-Stop! If you don't stop pulling...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:49.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SHE SAID REIN!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:59.52,top,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3}TRANSLATION: SHO STIFLER\NTIMING: ANDY ELLIS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:04.94,top,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1}EDITING: ALICIA ASHBY\NQUALITY CONTROL: WILLIAM HAGGARD
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:09.74,top,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3}FINAL QUALITY CONTROL: BECKY COTTRILL
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,IS SHE...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,TALKING ABOUT MEEE?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:23:04.98,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ROLEPLAYING LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:15.74,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:26.13,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4}REIN CRASHES THE STAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:18.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,YOU WERE TALKING ABOUT ME, RIGHT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:18.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.75,0:23:19.50,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,RIGHT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:20.25,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:21.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:21.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.75,0:23:22.50,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:23.25,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:24.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.00,0:23:24.75,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,YOU WERE, RIGHT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.75,0:23:25.50,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:26.13,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:30.63,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ROLEPLAYING LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:28.80,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:29.55,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:30.30,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:30.63,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,RUSH
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an9}LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7}LILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:40.18,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an5}THE BLUE CRYSTALS CRASH THE STAGE!
